          "sourceRefs": [
            "20260822-daily-prophet-001-source"
          ],
          "substantive": true,
          "aiOriginal": false,
          "quotation": false,
          "quotationVerified": true,
          "editorialOperations": [
            "whitespace-normalization",
            "boilerplate-exclusion",
            "source-paragraph-preservation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "20260822-daily-prophet-001-p11",
          "text": "11. The Koreish again commit hostilities and violate their pledge. War declared against those who had violated the truce. War not carried out xvi",
          "language": "en",
